   "text": "Hey, how's your day been so far?",
   "est_sec": 2.27,
   "gap_before": 0.56,
   "role": "greeting",
   "phrasing": "greet_10"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Doing alright, thanks.",
   "est_sec": 1.03,
   "gap_before": 0.33,
   "event": "greeting_answer",
   "phrasing": "greet_ans_28"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Okay, confession. I said on my CV that I'm advanced in spreadsheets and I'm really not.",
   "est_sec": 5.06,
   "gap_before": 0.57,
   "block": "job_interview.dlg23",
   "event": "ordinary_request"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Okay, honest question. How long until the interview?",
   "est_sec": 2.58,
   "gap_before": 1.14,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "job_interview.dlg23"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Two weeks.",
   "est_sec": 0.72,
   "gap_before": 1.27,
   "block": "job_interview.dlg23",
   "event": "ordinary_request"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Then you have two options. Learn enough to be genuinely solid in that time, or be honest in the interview and say intermediate.",
   "est_sec": 7.23,
   "gap_before": 0.36,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "job_interview.dlg23"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Can I actually learn that much in two weeks?",
   "est_sec": 2.89,
   "gap_before": 0.66,
   "block": "job_interview.dlg23",
   "event": "ordinary_request"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "You can get far. Focus on formulas, sorting and filtering, and basic charts. There are free tutorials for all of that.",
   "est_sec": 6.61,
   "gap_before": 0.79,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "job_interview.dlg23"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "And if they test me",
   "est_sec": 1.65,
   "gap_before": 0.3,
   "event": "distractor",
   "kind": "pause",
   "block": "job_interview.dlg23"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "on something I don't know?",
   "est_sec": 1.65,
   "gap_before": 1.99,
   "block": "job_interview.dlg23",
   "event": "ordinary_request"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Then admit it and explain how you'd find out. Pretending usually falls apart, but honesty plus curiosity tends to land well.",
